            unit: "u_11",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_12",
            type: "Thug",
            side: 3,
            x: 17,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_12",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Addogin",
            text: _("You heard the lady! Boys, it’s time to earn our keep!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Nafga",
            type: "Orcish Nightblade",
            side: 3,
            x: 17,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Nafga",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nafga",
            text: _("And what about me?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Addogin",
            text: _("Into the forest with you. If it comes to bloodshed, strike at them from behind. And don’t even think of running off with any corpses before I can collect our bounty!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "nafga_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Nafga",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("There must be some way to resolve this without fighting..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Finding another path westwards would cause great delay, which would cost Wesnoth many lives. We will fight our way through the mercenaries, through the elves and out the other side."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 0,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
